# Docs: https://github.com/BurntSushi/ripgrep/blob/master/GUIDE.md#automatic-filtering
# Exclude tracked lockfiles, generated files, and binary assets from interactive search and file pickers (rg, fd).

# Lockfiles and generated files
uv.lock
mise.lock
.mise/locks/
infra/.terraform.lock.hcl
infra/README.md
scripts/build_fonts.py.lock
assets/image-derivatives.json
scripts/mcp_context_cost/measurement-package-lock.json
src/www/sites/mcp_context_cost/measurements.json

# Binary images, video, icons, and fonts (keep static/humans.txt and static/robots.txt visible)
static/fonts/
static/img/
*.ico
*.jpg
*.png
